essageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":7,"deletions":1}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-13T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"e6135285cec7da66e4050e24c2b75e39778464b5","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge remote-tracking branch \u0027upstream/master\u0027 into branch-v1.2-partial-name-search-and-list-upkeep","messageBody":"Merge upstream master into partial-name search\n\nUpstream master adds supporter fields, stages and interactions.\nIntegrate these changes so the find/list feature stays compatible.\n\nResolve conflicts while preserving partial-name matching and\nupstream feature documentation. Fix the Messages line-length issue.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"a0b3c153dbe8e81ad76bfaa715d16084281fdf44","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Capture startup data-loading warnings","messageBody":"Startup loading falls back to an empty supporter list when data cannot\nbe read, but the failure is recorded only in the log.\n\nRetain a warning describing the data path and overwrite risk so it can\nbe displayed when the UI starts. Preserve valid-file and first-launch\nloading behavior, and verify that startup leaves the data untouched.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":16,"deletions":1},"test-code":{"insertions":126,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"fb3e2b6d04b3842be793befdfd3f1e00d7392b46","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Display data-loading warnings at startup","messageBody":"Users see an empty supporter list after a loading failure without an\nexplanation in the application window.\n\nPass initial feedback from startup loading to the result display and\nwrap its text so the overwrite advice remains readable. Keep normal\ncommand feedback and saving behavior, and retain existing UI entry\npoints for launches without a warning.\n\nValidation: Gradle checks and isolated JavaFX startup smoke tests pass.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":27,"deletions":3},"test-code":{"insertions":18,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"dcc690ee03b26f97e88c950c4b6b64ec87c26b59","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Document startup data-loading failure behavior","messageBody":"The guides do not describe the visible startup warning, and the User\nGuide names an outdated supporter data file path.\n\nExplain missing, valid and unreadable data-file launches, including\nhow to preserve data before continuing. Document the warning\u0027s UI\nhandoff and add manual checks for startup and later command feedback.\n\nLimit these updates to loading and saving documentation so other\nfeature sections remain intact.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":49,"deletions":5}}},{"hash":"77a6332486aeb8e593f00c2f409b54047a16b236","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Report interaction counts when deleting supporters","messageBody":"Deletion removes a supporter\u0027s embedded interaction history but does\nnot tell the user how many entries were removed.\n\nReport the count on a second line of the success message and clarify\nthe command usage. Verify empty, single, multiple and duplicate\ninteraction histories without changing existing deletion behavior.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":12,"deletions":4},"test-code":{"insertions":44,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"b0eacd03e365194deea736fcf4ac4fa887739aab","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Verify deletion preserves filters and viewed state","messageBody":"Deletion must use displayed indices, retain the active find filter,\nand keep other supporters\u0027 histories and viewed selection intact.\n\nExercise deletion through the parser, model and JSON storage. Check\nthat deleting the viewed supporter clears selection and that failed\ncommands preserve the displayed list, selection and saved file.\n\nReload saved data to verify the deleted history is absent and notes\non other supporters, including references to the deleted name, remain.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"test-code":{"insertions":162,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"f4483f62497a37516427f99971afa4e4e9fc87ff","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Document supporter deletion and history removal","messageBody":"The delete documentation does not describe interaction-count feedback\nor the effects on filtering and viewed selection.\n\nExplain the two-line result, permanent history removal and preserved\nfilter and unrelated data. Document the existing selection behavior\nand add manual deletion and reload checks, without claiming that a\ndetail panel is already present.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":54,"deletions":14}}}]}],"Oofky":[{"date":"2026-10-01T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"518d10d4513181934bb22de7c6b02eb03c34fe35","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add Ke Ying photo","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":3,"deletions":3}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-02T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"47b18da23482dfbc3dfac20b450c34af2cddb8a1","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #10 from aahilma/branch-photo","messageBody":"Branch photo","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-10-05T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"1905de20c803921cff9cd98a43ff0a9283cbf69b","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update acknowledgements","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":1,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"a4a09ca4a1ddb589f50de21867edab1237806d3c","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #23 from jiangyuning07/add-dg-nfrs-use-case","messageBody":"Add NFRs and use cases for view and set stages","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"724c689de26f5fa7f01c922718e4939cdfa2ea37","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge remote-tracking branch \u0027upstream/master\u0027 into pr/24","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"ed2a8e46dfa752a0c57b4104bec5161d06cf6c7b","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #24 from yyihengg/milestone1","messageBody":"Upda